WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Open troia-extension.vercel.app. In Installation, click Download Troia ZIP.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Extract the ZIP. On Mac, double-click it. On Windows, right-click and select Extract All.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Type chrome://extensions in the address bar. Turn on Developer mode at the top right.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Click Load unpacked. Choose the extracted troia-testnet folder containing manifest.json, then Select Folder.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Troia is installed. Keep its folder. Open the demo store, add an item and select Pay with crypto, then Stellar.
